{"id":"afafa0a35243a1e9","group":"58","path":"58/batch01/58-lem-fine.md","title":"Fine Structure Lemma","display":"lem-fine — Fine Structure Lemma","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-lem-fine","aliases":["58-lem-fine"],"display":"lem-fine — Fine Structure Lemma","depends_on":["[[../batch14/58-df-l-hierarchy.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","[[../batch19/58-df-def-operator.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-lem-fine"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-lem-fine</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-fine — Fine Structure Lemma"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"cfa29222af6471b2\" href=\"?note=cfa29222af6471b2\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-l-hierarchy.md\">../batch14/58-df-l-hierarchy.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9a2e92340a207163\" href=\"?note=9a2e92340a207163\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-def-operator.md\">../batch19/58-df-def-operator.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span> (ordinal, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_\\bullet\">\\(L_\\bullet\\)</span> (constructible hierarchy)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in L_\\alpha\">\\(X\\in L_\\alpha\\)</span> (constructible set below stage <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\)</span> (ordinal predicate from dependency)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LHierarchy}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{LHierarchy}_S\\)</span> (constructible-hierarchy predicate from dependency)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Def}\">\\(\\mathrm{Def}\\)</span> (definable-powerset operation from dependency)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}fine}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land\\mathrm{LHierarchy}_S(L_\\bullet)\\land X\\in L_\\alpha\n\\to\\exists\\beta\\in\\alpha\\;\n\\bigl(X\\in L_{\\beta+1}\\land X\\in\\mathrm{Def}(L_\\beta)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}fine}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land\\mathrm{LHierarchy}_S(L_\\bullet)\\land X\\in L_\\alpha\n\\to\\exists\\beta\\in\\alpha\\;\n\\bigl(X\\in L_{\\beta+1}\\land X\\in\\mathrm{Def}(L_\\beta)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Every member of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_\\alpha\">\\(L_\\alpha\\)</span> first appears at a successor stage and hence is definable, with parameters, over an earlier level.</li>\n<li>Because <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_\\bullet\">\\(L_\\bullet\\)</span> is a proper-class function and its defining dependency is explicitly metatheoretic, this lemma uses the same metatheoretic turnstile instead of treating <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_\\bullet\">\\(L_\\bullet\\)</span> as a set variable.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch14/58-df-l-hierarchy.md","status":"resolved","id":"cfa29222af6471b2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-l-hierarchy.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-def-operator.md","status":"resolved","id":"9a2e92340a207163","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-def-operator.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\alpha$ (ordinal, see [[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"L_\\bullet","display":false},{"tex":"X\\in L_\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ordinal}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LHierarchy}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Def}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}fine}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land\\mathrm{LHierarchy}_S(L_\\bullet)\\land X\\in L_\\alpha\n\\to\\exists\\beta\\in\\alpha\\;\n\\bigl(X\\in L_{\\beta+1}\\land X\\in\\mathrm{Def}(L_\\beta)\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"L_\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"L_\\bullet","display":false},{"tex":"L_\\bullet","display":false}],"bytes":1294,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3895","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-lem-fine.md|58-lem-fine]]（batch01）"}],"outgoing":["cfa29222af6471b2","5582a281f15a33c2","9a2e92340a207163"]}